174 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Dear Hiring Team\054\nI build design systems that ship as infrastructure\054 not as Figma libraries\056 At Remuner I built the system from scratch as the sole designer\072 component architecture\054 Figma variables\054 and a token pipeline from Token Studio through Style Dictionary to a published npm package with CI validation\056 The case is live at https\072\057\057manel\055leiva\056com\057cases\057design\055system\055remuner\056html\056\nBefore that I built the Abax system at Abacum\054 a two\055tier token architecture adopted across five squads\054 and co\055led the business case that won engineering investment\056 Design\055to\055code is where I work by default\072 the pipeline maps design decisions to implementation\054 and I enforced adoption with ESLint rules rather than documentation alone\056\nI have not worked in digital health\056 I have spent four years in domains with the same shape\072 dense data and users who depend on precision\056 Happy to walk through the Evinova fit\056\nBest\054\050Manel)
     /K [ 0 ]
     /P 173 0 R
     /Pg 168 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

